Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.22,0:00:19.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been these past few days?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.93,0:00:22.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I should've known you two were behind this!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.91,0:00:28.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How could you hide someone else's child?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You got me needlessly concerned!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.94,0:00:33.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll sue you for this!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.32,0:00:39.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you look for Kayo at all\Nover the past three days?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.40,0:00:43.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? Are you making me out to be the bad guy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.30,0:00:48.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.49,0:00:59.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo?! Let go of me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.68,0:01:01.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Needlessly concerned"?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.82,0:01:04.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The only thing you're concerned about is yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.67,0:01:05.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.03,0:02:44.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.61,0:02:47.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing,\NKayo?! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.28,0:02:49.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you listening to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.28,0:02:51.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Enough, Hinazuki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.96,0:02:55.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo-chan doesn't want to see you like this either.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.00,0:02:58.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking! You're treating me\Nlike a villain in front of my own daughter!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.69,0:03:01.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And after you kidnapped her, too!\NWho do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.84,0:03:02.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.93,0:03:07.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You deserve it for locking her in a shed and \Nnot caring when she goes missing for three days!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.47,0:03:11.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've no idea about the pains\Nand responsibilities of parenting,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so don't run your mouth, you brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.69,0:03:17.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go to—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You are Hinazuki Akemi-san, yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.94,0:03:23.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We are from Ishikari City Hall's\NChild Welfare Center.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.14,0:03:29.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We've come to talk to you \Nabout your daughter, Kayo-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.91,0:03:35.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You set me up! Damn the both of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.25,0:03:40.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We thought we couldn't get you\Nto meet us by ourselves,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.01,0:03:43.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so we asked Fujinuma-san for help.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.55,0:03:46.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who said I wouldn't meet you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.97,0:03:53.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry we asked you to do this.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be, Yashiro-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.80,0:04:00.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give her a piece of my mind,\Nso I'm actually glad to be of help.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.90,0:04:05.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who kidnapped my daughter!\NHurry up and call the police!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.61,0:04:10.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, we first need to discuss your usual\Nrelationship with your daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.14,0:04:14.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're you even talking about?\NWhat's wrong with how I treat Kayo?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.25,0:04:19.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We've decided that your daughter, Kayo-chan,\Nneeds to be taken into custody.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Custody?! I'm her legal {custodian}guardian!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But you didn't even try to look for her\Nwhen she went missing for three days.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.31,0:04:26.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's child negligence!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.45,0:04:28.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But it was all that brat's fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.93,0:04:31.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why am I being treated like a criminal?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.60,0:04:32.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Hinazuki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fine, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.89,0:04:37.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the police myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They can settle this!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.70,0:04:41.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come, Kayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.64,0:04:43.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.17,0:04:44.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We need to talk!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.02,0:04:46.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.38,0:04:50.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on! Quit dragging your feet!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.95,0:04:51.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.53,0:04:53.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I said come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.85,0:04:54.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Akemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.70,0:05:01.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Akemi, my girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.58,0:05:15.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We've been estranged ever since\NI made you split up with that man,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.26,0:05:20.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I've been worried about you two the whole time.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.94,0:05:28.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone how hard\N it is for a single mother to raise a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.94,0:05:33.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You must've been so lonely.\NIt must've been so hard on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.39,0:05:36.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I should've helped you...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I made you...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,shoulder it all yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.90,0:06:12.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please, this is all my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.44,0:06:16.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't think badly of Akemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.86,0:06:37.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those tears were probably born out of self-pity.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seemed like Kayo was\Navoiding looking at her mother
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.32,0:06:46.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because she wasn't someone\Nshe could cling to and cry on.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.60,0:06:51.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Akemi, my girl. Don't worry about Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.13,0:06:54.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I promise to take good care of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.57,0:07:01.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My child is the most important thing\Nin my life. He means the world to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.57,0:07:07.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must've felt the same at some point.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.79,0:07:11.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.80,0:07:15.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No need. You're the one\N who got us into gear, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.48,0:07:21.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could let your\Ncourageous efforts end in tragedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kayo will be all right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.31,0:07:29.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hardly have any memories of my father...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.93,0:07:33.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if this is how a father's words sound.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.84,0:07:42.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For getting me out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.54,0:07:48.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we go, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Town With Only Me Erased," by Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.33,0:08:02.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I grow older, old enough \Nto go wherever I want by myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.64,0:08:05.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway country.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.10,0:08:07.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway island.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island with nobody around.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island \Nwith no sorrow or suffering.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.53,0:08:25.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On that island, I'll climb a tree when I want,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}swim in the ocean when I want,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and sleep when I want.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.21,0:08:42.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I think about the town from which\NI've been erased, I feel lighthearted.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.82,0:08:45.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go far, far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.28,0:09:03.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I finally managed to save Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made sure her life would last far into the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.13,0:09:11.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From here on, Kayo will walk down her own path.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.07,0:09:17.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe that a bright future lies ahead of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru's been like this all day. Is he gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.65,0:09:32.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's a hero for saving Hinazuki,\Nbut look at him now...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.07,0:09:35.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru-kun. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.44,0:09:37.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't look fine at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.55,0:09:43.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can ya blame him? Hinazuki's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.04,0:09:46.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All's well that ends well, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.98,0:09:47.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.91,0:09:56.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think Kayo's mother will have to\Nstay away from her for a few years.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.01,0:09:59.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Which means Kayo's going to start\Na new life with her grandmother.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.48,0:10:04.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need for—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.89,0:10:12.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You said you couldn't let my\N courageous efforts end in tragedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.01,0:10:14.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Those words mean a lot to me right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.53,0:10:22.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be crude to call \Nthat ending a sort of compensation,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.56,0:10:26.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I'd still say your actions merited a reward.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.11,0:10:31.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to see Kayo smile?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.92,0:10:37.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like I get my reward as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.55,0:10:42.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Satoru, \Nwas Kayo at your place the entire time?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, at a hideout.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.79,0:10:45.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A hideout?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.65,0:10:50.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We hid Kayo in a bus the Izumi Elementary\Nice hockey team wasn't using anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.36,0:10:55.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So only kidnappers like you would go there, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.29,0:10:56.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's a joke, it ain't funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.67,0:11:05.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that Kayo's gone, the killer's targets\Nare down to Hiromi and Nakanishi Aya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.38,0:11:10.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, I have to make sure\Nneither of them are left alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.20,0:11:14.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just like with Kayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.25,0:11:19.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiromi's one thing, since he's my classmate,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.70,0:11:24.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Nakanishi Aya goes to Izumi Elementary\Nnext door, so it'll be hard to approach her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.96,0:11:29.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently she's often with Yuuki-san,\Nbut how am I supposed to talk to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.65,0:11:32.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She {had}has no clue who I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.43,0:11:34.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is going to be pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.53,0:11:39.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How to become friends\Nwith someone you don't know?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.99,0:11:44.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just go up and ask them to be your friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As if that'd work—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're thinking, "As if that'd work," aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she psychic?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've already got Kayo-chan,\Nbut your eyes are wandering, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,H-How did you know that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.58,0:11:56.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was just a bluff.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.10,0:12:01.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, it is a girl... She's always by herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You won't get anywhere with that attitude.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.99,0:12:09.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Focus on a positive outcome.\N As they say, nothing ventured, nothing gained.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.19,0:12:15.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need to stop by somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.74,0:12:18.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are going to the kids' center, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.07,0:12:21.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll meet you there, then. Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.66,0:12:23.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.57,0:12:37.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she gets out of cram school at 6:30 p.m.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.60,0:12:41.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can walk Hiromi home\N and still get back here in time.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.56,0:12:45.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First I need to figure out what they do every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.91,0:13:00.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya's daily routine was simple.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.55,0:13:02.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she were to be kidnapped,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.31,0:13:06.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it'd most likely happen at this time,\Nright after she's let out of cram school.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.61,0:13:07.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.33,0:13:11.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Am I ever glad to see you! Give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.63,0:13:15.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You just {\i0}had{\i1} to show up when I wanted\Nto follow her and see where she lived.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why would you buy so much stuff at once?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What could I do? It was on sale.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.62,0:13:21.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.01,0:13:23.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say it out loud. It'll only make it feel heavier.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be heavy even if I kept my mouth shut!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.47,0:13:33.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Sensei.\NMom went overboard shopping.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.35,0:13:42.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Sensei...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you married?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.03,0:13:46.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.06,0:13:53.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Satoru. You can only \Nget married if you have a partner.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.52,0:13:57.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Then they need to be ready for it, \Nand the time's got to be right... It's complicated.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.53,0:14:03.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, maybe I'm being too cautious because\Nof a painful experience I've been through.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.98,0:14:06.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. \NI didn't mind answering that question.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.33,0:14:15.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was actually gonna ask you a different question.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.99,0:14:20.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How to approach a girl you don't know?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.52,0:14:24.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I know her, but she doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.10,0:14:27.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the cautious type,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.45,0:14:31.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so I'd start by making her less wary of me,\Neven if it meant beating around the bush.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Make her less wary?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.66,0:14:36.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. In other words, show off your good side.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.55,0:14:41.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Like, if you're good at sports\N or cooking. Use whatever you can.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.13,0:14:44.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The moment she takes an interest in it,\N she'll let her guard down.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.01,0:14:48.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be too impressed.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.27,0:14:52.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at expressing my \Nfeelings {in a direct manner}directly, so I just rely on logic.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.55,0:14:58.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Something's sticking out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.68,0:15:00.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that, Satoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.22,0:15:02.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorr—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.24,0:15:07.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You caught me, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.66,0:15:12.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Candy?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.95,0:15:16.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now that you've seen it, \Nno point in hiding it anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You eat some too! Become my accomplice!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.61,0:15:26.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ever since I quit smoking three years ago,\Ncandy has been my go-to substitute.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.13,0:15:30.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I'm by myself, I can't relax without it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.43,0:15:33.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.89,0:15:41.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gimme one too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.04,0:15:51.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go do my homework at the kids' center.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.11,0:15:51.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hiromi. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.03,0:15:57.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,First Hinazuki, and now it's like\Nyou're Hiromi's guardian.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.50,0:16:03.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can we talk in private, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.52,0:16:04.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.75,0:16:08.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hiromi. I'll join you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.81,0:16:09.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.54,0:16:13.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's really on your mind, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.89,0:16:18.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I saw how determined you were\Nto save Hinazuki at all costs,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.04,0:16:22.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but everything went well, \Nso what's wrong with you now?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.29,0:16:26.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If something's bothering you,\Ncould you tell me about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.67,0:16:31.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't really explain it. It's too far-fetched.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna dig deep and take a step forward like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.15,0:16:40.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a superhero, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.39,0:16:43.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If there's another part to this, take me with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.92,0:16:54.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you make of these footprints, Kenya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.15,0:16:57.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,An adult's been through here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.06,0:16:58.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not just that. Take a closer look.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.07,0:17:01.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think they had their shoes wrapped in cloth.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It wasn't to prevent them from slipping, was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Probably to avoid leaving distinctive footprints.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The backpack's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.85,0:17:19.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So's the box with the briquettes.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.59,0:17:21.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think there are fewer boxes in general.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A lot of torn up cartons, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.78,0:17:27.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody must've taken the contents with them.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.24,0:17:30.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's your point, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.89,0:17:37.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the man who supposedly\Nshowed up late at night when Kayo was here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.22,0:17:41.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The guy who left a backpack\Nfull of sketchy stuff here, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.01,0:17:46.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure he's a murderer\Nwho's targeting children.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.73,0:17:49.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.63,0:17:52.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know that this sounds unbelievable.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.71,0:17:57.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.25,0:18:00.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't give you a proper explanation right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I saw the backpack and the briquettes,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.81,0:18:06.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that this was a hiding place\Nfor a serial killer's murdering tools.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.07,0:18:12.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Even I know that it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.20,0:18:14.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But that's how I feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.25,0:18:16.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you now since it's all over.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.79,0:18:19.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The whole Kayo thing? Preventing \Nher mother's abuse was only part of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.90,0:18:24.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to protect her from this murderer.\NThat's why I didn't want to leave her alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.74,0:18:33.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you aspire to become a detective\N or a novelist when you grow up, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.88,0:18:37.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The issue isn't whether what \Nyou're saying is too far-fetched or not.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.86,0:18:40.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's whether I believe you or not.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.28,0:18:48.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to walk me this close to home.\NI'll be fine. I'm a boy, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.04,0:18:50.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I had something to do here, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.81,0:18:57.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to believe you too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.22,0:19:06.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can, \Nso tell me if you ever need help, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.40,0:19:09.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.16,0:19:10.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.98,0:19:13.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.44,0:19:25.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Satoru, 99 percent of me\N thinks your theory couldn't possibly be true.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.20,0:19:29.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But the other one percent thinks \Nit's not completely out of the question.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.80,0:19:34.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. From the outside, it probably looks like\NI'm playing detective, making up crimes—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Playing detective is fine by me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It might be because of \Nwhat's been happening lately,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.80,0:19:47.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I think that we should let your feelings guide us.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.22,0:19:51.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You believed in me and \Ngave me your side of the story.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.91,0:19:55.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So I want to do my part and believe in you too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.69,0:19:59.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's for my own sake that I want to trust you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.03,0:20:02.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Similar to someone wanting to be trusted,\Nbut the other way around.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.72,0:20:08.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kenya. Thanks, Hiromi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,I could've saved her!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.09,0:20:17.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}18 years ago, I think I said \Nthose words to my mother and cried.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never want to go through that again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.98,0:20:24.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't leave anybody alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.61,0:20:27.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can save them!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.23,0:20:36.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remember to get your parents\Nto fill out that handout!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.94,0:20:37.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.68,0:20:42.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to come with me somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.90,0:20:48.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru, wanna hit up the hideout now?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.07,0:20:50.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we've got something to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.37,0:20:52.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you later, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.51,0:20:53.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.55,0:20:54.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Laters...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.20,0:20:59.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What're they sneaking around for?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.35,0:21:00.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're no fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.68,0:21:01.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna follow them, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.48,0:21:02.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.17,0:21:02.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
